		//   token="playorskip(72)|onclientconnected(1)|NEW_character_creation Slave Galley (server-side)"
		//   ... followed by "PlayOrSkip".
		// Without these the playfield loads (ambient audio plays) but the client never launches the
		// Slave Galley character-creation scene, leaving a black screen. The preceding 0x96B8DC59 /
		// 0x642CD3D6 / ApplySpell (0x6B87E316) / 0x40749B8A / 0xF98E10B3 packets set up the initial
		// character/world state the script expects; the trailing 0xBADF5A4B packets are part of the
		// same scripted setup. All packets reuse the static editor temp instance 0x021662C8 and the
		// same request ids the live client emits, so a byte-for-byte replay reproduces retail exactly.

